    <string name="app_name">Health Connect Bridge</string>
    <string name="privacy_text">Privacy policy\n\nHealth Connect Bridge reads the health data you allow in Health Connect (heart rate, steps, calories, sleep, exercise and more) and sends it only to the server you set up in the app.\n\nNo data is sent to third parties, and the app collects no usage statistics. You can revoke the permissions at any time in the Health Connect settings.</string>

